  "self_heal": {
    "_comment": "Self-healing actuator parameters (SOFTWARE_SPEC §21.5). burnish/gradient are MODELLED from relay-burnishing + charge literature; bench-measured before Rev-1 sign-off (WORKFLOW claim rules)",
