    "source": "datasheet: TI BQ25504 SLUSAH0G VBIAS and VBAT_ACCURACY (§7.5), Eq. 3; vbat_ov_v is modelled from rov1/rov2. The harvester charges the cell without the CE gate, so Phase 14 asserts vbat_ov_v x (1 + accuracy) <= battery.charge_limit_v.",
